Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 12:25:14 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] fix(trace): enforce protected face and edge clearance

Keep Trace on the selected line. Check the whole tool along each move and refuse a path that hits a protected item. Enable protected picks in the viewport, through MCP, and in saved projects.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <codex@openai.com>

Fixes #3348
