Subject: [PATCH 2/3] fix(3d): keep Finish3D clear of protected items

Clip finishing paths against the full tool keep-out. Carry the keep-out
through WCS yaw. Route rapid links and refuse remaining contact by name.
Keep the original moves when no protected items are set.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <codex@openai.com>

Fixes #3347
